Subject: [PATCH] Fix vendor dashboard UI: add missing routes, correct CSS
 class names, improve responsive design

- Added missing vendor routes: /vendor/deliveries and /vendor/notifications
- Fixed VendorSidebar.tsx: corrected CSS class names to match vendor-shell.css
- Fixed VendorHeader.tsx: removed non-existent route references, improved tooltip styling
- Updated vendor-shell.css: aligned styles with component class names, improved responsive design and animations
